### Agents - Pipeline
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/agents/pipelines/prototype
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Agents - Library
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/agents/library
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Agents - List skills
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/agents/skills
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Agents - Get skill
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/agents/skills/{{agentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Agents - Save skill
POST {{apiRoot}}/api/agents/skills
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"agent_id": "code-reviewer",
	"content": "Review for bugs first, then style."
}

### Agents - Delete skill
DELETE {{apiRoot}}/api/agents/skills/{{agentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Agents - Get prompt override
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/agents/{{agentId}}/prompt
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Agents - Save prompt override
PUT {{apiRoot}}/api/agents/{{agentId}}/prompt
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"content": "Always include concrete remediation steps."
}

### Agents - Delete prompt override
DELETE {{apiRoot}}/api/agents/{{agentId}}/prompt
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
